#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119522 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ecdc6a5a-5aba-5547-97aa-db3cd2e90ae6" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Minor in a NxN Matrix"}] :question/id #uuid "3545b168-5226-5f47-ac0d-3ff5509e866e" :question/math-academy-id "e-4447" :question/problem "What is the minor of $a_{13}$ in \n$[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & 0 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]$" :question/worked-solution "To get the minor of $a_{13}$, we remove the $1$st row and $3$rd column:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}∗ & ∗ & 2 & ∗ \\\\ 5 & 1 & ∗ & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & ∗ & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & ∗ & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}5 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}|\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119523 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "58148550-e41f-5df0-80dc-e783619cf87d" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Cofactor in a NxN Matrix"}] :question/id #uuid "8e61e639-f165-5157-91c0-e9a6faf734a6" :question/math-academy-id "e-4448" :question/problem "Find the cofactor of $d_{23}$ in \n$[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 3 & -6 \\\\ 7 & -3 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 8 & 9 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]$" :question/worked-solution "First, to get the minor of $d_{23}$, we remove the $2$nd row and $3$rd column:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & ∗ & -6 \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & -2 & ∗ \\\\ 6 & 0 & ∗ & 9 \\\\ 5 & 4 & ∗ & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 9 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the cofactor of $d_{23}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{23} & =(-1)^{2+3}{M}_{23} \\\\  & =-{M}_{23} \\\\  & =-|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 9 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119524 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "055b3809-f9aa-5dcc-8c1a-b0eb71020d7e" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a NxN Matrix Using Cofactor Expansion"}] :question/id #uuid "3e091496-053c-59fb-90d6-d8fb89ea6004" :question/math-academy-id "e-4449" :question/problem "Calculate the determinant of the matrix\n$\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & 0 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}$" :question/worked-solution "We use the cofactor expansion along the first row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & ={a}_{11}{C}_{11}+{a}_{12}{C}_{12}+{a}_{13}{C}_{13}+{a}_{14}{C}_{14} \\\\  & =0\\cdot {C}_{11}+0\\cdot {C}_{12}+2\\cdot {C}_{13}+0\\cdot {C}_{14} \\\\  & =2{C}_{13} \\\\  & =2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}∗ & ∗ & 2 & ∗ \\\\ 5 & 1 & ∗ & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & ∗ & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & ∗ & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2(-1)^{1+3}|\\begin{aligned}5 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2(5|\\begin{aligned}6 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{aligned}|-1|\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 0\\end{aligned}|+0|\\begin{aligned}1 & 6 \\\\ -6 & 3\\end{aligned}|) \\\\  & =2(5(6\\cdot 0+1\\cdot 3)-(1\\cdot 0-(-1)\\cdot (-6))+0(1\\cdot 3-6\\cdot (-6))) \\\\  & =2(15+6+0) \\\\  & =2\\cdot 21 \\\\  & =42\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186309257 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ecdc6a5a-5aba-5547-97aa-db3cd2e90ae6" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Minor in a NxN Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b776090a-5b43-59fa-867d-cb78babf6491" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}3 & 11 & 7 \\\\ 1 & -8 & 8 \\\\ 4 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309259} {:answer/id #uuid "5156ed76-b75e-51f6-9045-a6dd725f9217" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}3 & 3 & 7 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & 1 & 8 \\\\ -6 & 4 & -2\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309260} {:answer/id #uuid "b40162b0-b56b-5b8c-80da-9985b7a65806" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 3 & 11 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & 1 & -8\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 175921