uestion/worked-solution "First, to get the minor of ${d}_{51}$, we remove the $5$th row and $1$st column: \n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & -8 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ ∗ & 5 & 0 & 7 & 1 \\\\ ∗ & 0 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ ∗ & 0 & 6 & 8 & 3 \\\\ 11 & ∗ & ∗ & ∗ & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{51}=|\\begin{aligned}-8 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 0 & 7 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 6 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nNow, the cofactor of ${d}_{51}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{51} & =(-1)^{5+1}{M}_{51} \\\\  & ={M}_{51} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-8 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 0 & 7 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 6 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186309271 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "58148550-e41f-5df0-80dc-e783619cf87d" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Cofactor in a NxN Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d121efe-a33f-5699-a3e3-cd3ec4a36782" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -5 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309273} {:answer/id #uuid "1b6eab7a-1fe0-58dc-85b7-8a7c4dbbb40c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}1 & -8 & 2 & -5 \\\\ 3 & 5 & 6 & 3 \\\\ -1 & -1 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 5 & 3 & 8\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309274} {:answer/id #uuid "0007e7ad-808e-5128-98f4-009625a08aa8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}1 & -8 & 2 & -5 \\\\ -1 & -1 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 5 & 3 & 8 \\\\ -9 & 3 & 7 & -9\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309275} {:answer/id #uuid "207afcce-2b99-5b0f-a0e3-16d11bff390e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-|\\begin{aligned}1 & -8 & 2 & -5 \\\\ -1 & -1 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 5 & 3 & 8 \\\\ -9 & 3 & 7 & -9\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309276} {:answer/id #uuid "1c48f884-9a2e-5b38-8e98-927b8774adea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -5 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309277}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1c48f884-9a2e-5b38-8e98-927b8774adea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -5 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309277} :answer-field/id #uuid "a8aba7e0-7133-5da3-af8c-b13e3994794a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309272}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "ebbea878-b1bd-5990-8d32-9b0b85df7ff7" :question/math-academy-id "q-130906" :question/problem "Find the cofactor of ${x}_{52}$ in \n$X=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -8 & 2 & -5 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 5 & 6 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 5 & 3 & 8 & 3 \\\\ -9 & 3 & 7 & -9 & 0\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, to get the minor of ${x}_{52}$, we remove the $5$th row and $2$nd column: \n\n$$\nX=[\\begin{aligned}1 & ∗ & 2 & -5 & -1 \\\\ 3 & ∗ & 6 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & ∗ & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & ∗ & 3 & 8 & 3 \\\\ ∗ & 3 & ∗ & ∗ & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{52}=|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -5 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nNow, the cofactor of ${x}_{52}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{52} & =(-1)^{5+2}{M}_{52} \\\\  & =-{M}_{52} \\\\  & =-|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -5 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186309278 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "055b3809-f9aa-5dcc-8c1a-b0eb71020d7e" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a NxN Matrix Using Cofactor Expansion"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f6cab142-d80e-5de6-b1b8-dc6237a1f8a1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "115" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309280} {:answer/id #uuid "7a1e569a-4f10-5925-bc3d-bea1bf0d312d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "36" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309281} {:answer/id #uuid "f93a37ec-01d5-567c-86b1-7ed7ef02271e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{11}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309282} {:answer/id #uuid "a76a4aa1-6fad-59cf-84d5-8ccf0eaec784" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{31}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309283} {:answer/id #uuid "77f2a06d-112c-5b9b-bdf1-f358b4400985" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309284}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7a1e569a-4f10-5925-bc3d-bea1bf0d312d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "36" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309281} :answer-field/id #uuid "e6eb7013-e08a-57d0-95ff-edc2c642f053" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309279}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "53b7a785-0378-50bc-93de-51db7267c0f1" :question/math-academy-id "q-131114" :question/problem "Calculate the determinant of the matrix\n$Z=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2} & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 3 & 8\\end{aligned}]$" :question/worked-solution "We use the cofactor expansion along the first row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(Z) & ={z}_{11}{C}_{11}+{z}_{12}{C}_{12}+{z}_{13}{C}_{13}+{z}_{14}{C}_{14} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot {C}_{11}+0\\cdot {C}_{12}+0\\cdot {C}_{13}+0\\cdot {C}_{14} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{C}_{11} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2} & ∗ & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ ∗ & 5 & 3 & 2 \\\\ ∗ & 2 & 3 & 8\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(-1)^{1+1}|\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 8\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 8\\end{aligned}|-(-2)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 8\\end{aligned}|+0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}5 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}|) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(0+2(5\\cdot 8-2\\cdot 2)+0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 72 \\\\  & =36\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186309285 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "055b3809-f9aa-5dcc-8c1a-b0eb71020d7e" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a NxN Matrix Using Cofactor Expansion"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d1ff31bc-464b-5951-8e8a-ecfc6ffa7820" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309287} {:answer/id #uuid "ef027b49-c589-591f-b3c5-b11082f1b1a4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309288} {:answer/id #uuid "e1425929-71fa-567f-823e-ddef0743f838" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "36" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309289} {:answer/id #uuid "f50869eb-85d0-5044-9c27-54cc527703b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309290} {:answer/id #uuid "6ce4e385-b67e-57e3-a45a-00f1c544e5f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-19" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309291}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e1425929-71fa-567f-823e-ddef0743f838" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "36" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309289} :answer-field/id #uuid "99cd1493-2618-539b-b53d-167188a1fcc9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309286}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "ee609e3a-80e3-597a-af29-78a60ab5b55b" :question/math-academy-id "q-32727" :question/problem "Calculate the determinant of the matrix\n$S=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -5 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 2 & 2\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "We use the cofactor expansion along the first row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(S) & ={s}_{11}{C}_{11}+{s}_{12}{C}_{12}+{s}_{13}{C}_{13}+{s}_{14}{C}_{14} \\\\  & =0\\cdot {C}_{11}+2\\cdot {C}_{12}+0\\cdot {C}_{13}+0\\cdot {C}_{14} \\\\  & =2{C}_{12} \\\\  & =2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}∗ & 2 & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ 1 & ∗ & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & ∗ & -5 & 4 \\\\ 4 & ∗ & 2 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2(-1)^{1+2}|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -5 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 2 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-2(1\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-5 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 2\\end{aligned}|-0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{aligned}|+0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{aligned}|) \\\\  & =-2((-5\\cdot 2-4\\cdot 2)-0+0) \\\\  & =-2\\cdot (-18) \\\\  & =36\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186309292 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "055b3809-f9aa-5dcc-8c1a-b0eb71020d7e" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a NxN Matrix Using Cofactor Expansion"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b93e3202-0fa8-59e1-b964-bbea05471f39" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-432" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309294} {:answer/id #uuid "da8ec3d6-8915-5e60-ac59-b1b5152f0306" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309295} {:answer/id #uuid "8ee87210-5b1d-52d3-bfb2-f887ae2ebb6d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-108" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309296} {:answer/id #uuid "3d1161e4-480f-5ec6-a7e1-7e3761bc7952" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-198" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309297} {:answer/id #uuid "1e07b9ad-bd0a-5ad9-ae44-a16f85e8e46a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "108" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309298}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b93e3202-0fa8-59e1-b964-bbea05471f39" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-432" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309294} :answer-field/id #uuid "848bc78f-3dc8-5ae8-a006-0e142e6ab9c0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309293}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "74c0a1e0-6d1b-5536-9431-c9f784493f16" :question/math-academy-id "q-32791" :question/problem "Calculate the determinant of the matrix\n$T=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 9 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 6 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 3 & -2\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "We use the cofactor expansion along the first row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(T) & ={t}_{11}{C}_{11}+{t}_{12}{C}_{12}+{t}_{13}{C}_{13}+{t}_{14}{C}_{14} \\\\  & =(-1)\\cdot {C}_{11}+0\\cdot {C}_{12}+4\\cdot {C}_{13}+0\\cdot {C}_{14} \\\\  & =-{C}_{11}+4{C}_{13} \\\\  & =(-1)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-1 & ∗ & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ ∗ & 6 & 0 & 2 \\\\ ∗ & 0 & 3 & -2\\end{aligned}|+4\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}∗ & ∗ & 4 & ∗ \\\\ 9 & 0 & ∗ & 0 \\\\ -1 & 6 & ∗ & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & ∗ & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-1)\\cdot (-1)^{1+1}|\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 3 & -2\\end{aligned}|+4\\cdot (-1)^{1+3}|\\begin{aligned}9 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 6 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-(0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}|-0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}6 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}|+0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{aligned}|)+4(9\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}6 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}|-0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{aligned}|+0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-1 & 6 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}|) \\\\  & =-0+4\\cdot 9(6\\cdot (-2)-2\\cdot 0) \\\\  & =36\\cdot (-12) \\\\  & =-432\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186309299 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "58148550-e41f-5df0-80dc-e783619cf87d" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Cofactor in a NxN Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "280e95c5-3f84-5fb6-bb3d-ccccb96fea5c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-|\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 2 & -9 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 2\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309301} {:answer/id #uuid "0717789c-241d-52d3-9cf8-4b53b1661a2f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 2 & -9 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 2\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309302} {:answer/id #uuid "a8fb6d5c-d554-5afb-b696-df5aa51b6a71" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}7 & -3 & 4 & 2 \\\\ 8 & -2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -9 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 5 & 2 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309303} {:answer/id #uuid "dcbe8a3d-3be0-5e78-9588-5d6ca969406f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 2 & -9 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 10\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309304} {:answer/id #uuid "eead6dd2-b700-55b4-8478-2f6b793cdbfc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-|\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 2 & -9 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 10\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309305}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dcbe8a3d-3be0-5e78-9588-5d6ca969406f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 2 & -9 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 10\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309304} :answer-field/id #uuid "9585fb38-1f53-5bf9-92dc-ed8e675bb8d9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309300}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f1bc6daa-53f0-51ba-94e5-aef13e4c2d91" :question/math-academy-id "q-32793" :question/problem "Find the cofactor of ${d}_{15}$ in \n$D=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & -3 & 4 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 8 & -2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 2 & -9 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 10 & 2\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, to get the minor of ${d}_{15}$, we remove the $1$st row and $5$th column: \n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & ∗ & ∗ & ∗ & 2 \\\\ 0 & 8 & -2 & 0 & ∗ \\\\ 6 & 2 & -9 & 4 & ∗ \\\\ 1 & 5 & 2 & 1 & ∗ \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 10 & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n \nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{15}=|\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 2 & -9 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 10\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the cofactor of ${d}_{15}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{15} & =(-1)^{1+5}{M}_{15} \\\\  & ={M}_{15} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 2 & -9 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 10\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186309306 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ecdc6a5a-5aba-5547-97aa-db3cd2e90ae6" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Minor in a NxN Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f283e187-0a7d-58a4-8e95-96baf63f59fd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 8 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 5 & 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 11 & 2\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309308} {:answer/id #uuid "28f7c4de-6d89-558e-a412-c5ad4a7e5836" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 5 & -5 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 11 & 2\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309309} {:answer/id #uuid "b63dafd3-0e3e-56ee-8271-609fe83f6eaa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}0 & 7 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 5 & -5 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 11 & 2\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309310} {:answer/id #uuid "f330aa4a-b22d-5725-8810-b52237a7b527" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 5 &